<title>MALAYSIA: Cagamas accepts 94-day notes at average 6.601 pct.</title>
<headline>Cagamas accepts 94-day notes at average 6.601 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's national mortgage corporation Cagamas Bhd said on Thursday it accepted bids at an average discount of 6.601 percent at its auction of 94-day notes for 850 million ringgit.</p>
<p>The bids accepted were in the high/low range of 6.635/400 percent.</p>
<p>Total amount bidded was 1,96 billion ringgit.</p>
</text>
